  "title": "Royal Gold to Release First Quarter 2026 Results on May 6, 2026",
  "summary": "Royal Gold, Inc. (NASDAQ: RGLD) announced today that it will report its first quarter 2026 results on Wednesday, May 6, 2026, after market close. A conference call will be held on Thursday, May 7, 2026, at 12 p.m. Eastern Time (10:00 a.m. Mountain Time). The call will be webcast live and archived on the Company's website for a limited time. Dial-In Numbers: North America (Toll-Free): +1 833-461-5787 International (Toll): +1 585-542-9983 Access Code: 371420639 Webcast URL: https://events.q4inc.co",
